  "title": "Spatchcock Chicken",
  "description": "This flavorsome spatchcock chicken seasoned with tarragon, paprika, black pepper, and lemon takes about half the time it takes to roast a whole bird.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
